==Description==
The '''DarkMist Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 6 of the premium [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{CandyCorns|150 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|142}} ({{Robux|106}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{CandyCorns|520 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|322}} ({{Robux|250}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

The '''DarkMist Nametag''' has purple gradient text and a black outline. It also emits a dark purple fog and purple electricity around itself.

